{"version":1,"key":"card:579","content":{"id":579,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ad9ff768-7428-43c8-ae27-719410f8c3b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"XSS（Cross-Site Scripting），跨站脚本攻击，为防止与 CSS 缩写混淆，使用了 XSS 的缩写。攻击原理是攻击者通过将恶意代码注入到页面，页面未经处理执行了恶意代码，从而导致用户信息泄露，页面被篡改等问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f69e22a2-ada2-44a2-b15e-70077ce25a2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"XSS 主要分为三种类型："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"11727dfc-2dbf-4d25-9235-e9bce0a74749","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"06149791-a2d9-4455-92d8-8c12b42166c0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e9d08de-1eff-4e89-ab06-2be39d0b3008","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反射型"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b969ba74-2ef6-45ed-a206-167155867db5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"69baacc5-d600-41cc-a88e-9cbf2ebbb3db","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a7695ca-dbe7-4bb0-ab80-ef74aa189aa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将恶意脚本作为请求参数传递给服务端，服务端未进行过滤，直接将恶意脚本作为网页内容返回，在用户页面执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"944edfdd-bcf2-4317-8d10-5ef86e905145","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a5da4f1-d2c9-4e2e-bd50-2a494e376d32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如制作了一个带恶意代码的 URL 链接，服务端根据 URL 链接上的参数构建了 HTML 页面，包括恶意代码，如果将此链接通过邮件发送给用户，用户一点击就中招"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f6831834-5bbb-422f-bdf5-abe94111b825","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20645e8c-8a0c-4e0f-ab6b-e896feae2abd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存储型"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"dd128dbc-174b-4dcc-bbb2-9361b11ee668","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d6d9f7d2-d2b6-4e41-804c-5082151b5795","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6c4bb710-8276-462d-8d88-1578828a1ed8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户提交恶意脚本到服务器，并持久化在数据库中，当其他用户访问时，从数据库中取出脚本并被用户页面加载执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f3e555e4-e536-4224-b0ed-9873643a57e3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8e62f79e-0497-4764-87e3-fff68e00560b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如用户通过评论注入恶意脚本，其他用户查看评论时执行了该恶意脚本"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c65cb141-7f26-4159-b792-9b7720af1b10","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d61849f0-7eec-46d1-8a4e-d5f7a83be4da","children":[{"type":"formatted","tex